<div id="S3.SS1.p6" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS1.p6.1" class="ltx_p">For <math id="S3.SS1.p6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0\leq i\leq 1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0\leq i\leq 1</annotation></semantics></math>, let <math id="S3.SS1.p6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Z_{i}=\{A_{1}(i),A_{1}(i+2)\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Z_{i}=\{A_{1}(i),A_{1}(i+2)\}</annotation></semantics></math> be the centers of the 2-star-forest <math id="S3.SS1.p6.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{Z_{i}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>S</mi><msub><mi>Z</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{Z_{i}}</annotation></semantics></math> consisting of stars</p>
