<p id="S3.SS5.p1.2" class="ltx_p">and let <math id="S3.SS5.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{Z_{i}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>S</mi><msub><mi>Z</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{Z_{i}}</annotation></semantics></math> contain the following stars:</p>
